      "problem": "What is the remainder when $3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-18x-1$ is divided by $3{x}^{2}-8x-2?$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+2 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}-8x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-18x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}-16x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-16x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3.$",
